                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0eae0dda-7afd-4f09-a68b-1716d4d7a9f3",
                        "entry_id": "3cec2497-355f-3af7-b152-5582ab61de6b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "berillen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "354d85e5-5136-3200-8a22-bc11445d4b99",
                        "entry_id": "3cec2497-355f-3af7-b152-5582ab61de6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een kleurloos, wit, gelig wit, geelgroen tot groen, roze, blauwig tot groenblauw, rood of goudgeel aluminium-beryllium-silicaat met formule Al₂Be₃Si₆O₁₈, waarvan de heldere soorten (aquamarijn, goudberil, smaragd) als edelgesteenten gelden"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "92476456-08ae-494d-8cf6-b27e0283e202",
                                "sense_id": "354d85e5-5136-3200-8a22-bc11445d4b99",
                                "text": "Uit geslepen, heldere stukken beril werden in de middeleeuwen in Italië de eerste brillen gemaakt"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1a42e4d-64ff-495d-9d7a-3af36a97c232",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cec2497-355f-3af7-b152-5582ab61de6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "354d85e5-5136-3200-8a22-bc11445d4b99",
                        "target_lang_word": "beryl",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "beryl",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85d9e129-43e2-3029-9c9f-8db58c933ccd",
                                        "entry_id": "096e41cd-ec71-3d23-a458-adb8c3322d6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mineral of pegmatite deposits, often used as a gemstone (molecular formula Be₃Al₂Si₆O₁₈)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5cf9a4b-cf11-4221-a12e-ce6fd8edf9f6",
                                                "sense_id": "85d9e129-43e2-3029-9c9f-8db58c933ccd",
                                                "text": "The sunset had been magnificent, and the Thames was floating in dark radiance; the waves wearing that transparent clearness, which gives more the idea of melted beryl, than aught else: every little circle in the water had that trembling light which characterises precious stones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75bf3430-5072-43b5-8430-0c9a63d3a8ae",
                                                "sense_id": "85d9e129-43e2-3029-9c9f-8db58c933ccd",
                                                "text": "Although there are dozens of different types of gems, among the best known and most important are diamond, ruby and sapphire, emerald and other gem forms of the mineral beryl, chrysoberyl, tanzanite, tsavorite, topaz and jade."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e49731f-c904-348e-8f24-947d9b045d78",
                                        "entry_id": "096e41cd-ec71-3d23-a458-adb8c3322d6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An example (a stone) of the mineral beryl."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9159239-d83a-44ee-9104-50443a0afe9a",
                                                "sense_id": "5e49731f-c904-348e-8f24-947d9b045d78",
                                                "text": "The crown was set with six beryls of excellent size and color."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e65d893d-4c0c-47fe-bae9-7fadd49d91af",
                                                "sense_id": "5e49731f-c904-348e-8f24-947d9b045d78",
                                                "text": "The appearance of the wheels and their work was like unto the colour of a beryl […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "304730a0-5994-42d0-8337-9c2ab0a42dbd",
                                                "sense_id": "5e49731f-c904-348e-8f24-947d9b045d78",
                                                "text": "His buskins were laced with gold, and from his belt hung a sword, narrow of blade and keen, the hilt rough with beryls and black diamonds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a391e20-df27-3bdb-82e6-89e72a0b81a9",
                                        "entry_id": "096e41cd-ec71-3d23-a458-adb8c3322d6b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dull blueish green color."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "beryl",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58d5ca79-1e7b-3e6c-bd00-b0c82ebc3d96",
                                        "entry_id": "712fe4c3-6077-3473-9714-88f543e6c519",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a dull bluish green colour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ca81dda-2b95-411d-8683-0a852def0b41",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cec2497-355f-3af7-b152-5582ab61de6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "354d85e5-5136-3200-8a22-bc11445d4b99",
                        "target_lang_word": "berilo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "berilo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7422e64c-4e65-3951-9679-21ef892e6507",
                                        "entry_id": "d07b96ef-95b2-3bf4-a4f0-9335b7aeb0d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Silicato de aluminio y berilio, de fórmula Be₃Al₂(SiO₃)₆, o bien Be₃Al₂Si₆O₁₈. Puede ser incoloro, si es puro, o de tonalidades diversas, según los elementos metálicos que en cantidades menores (impurezas) entran en su composición y generan variedades, tales como las mencionadas en «relacionados»:"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0caef02a-bbb5-46bd-9423-828be16b610d",
                                                "sense_id": "7422e64c-4e65-3951-9679-21ef892e6507",
                                                "text": "El berilo es un mineral bastante común, de origen generalmente pegmatítico, asociado a rocas graníticas. El metal berilio, de bajo radio iónico, se concentra en los fluídos residuales y forma minerales diversos (berilo, fenaquita, berilonita, etc.) que se asocian espacial y genéticamente a pegmatitas. Sin embargo, pueden establecerse diferencias entre las distintas variedades, sobre todo en lo que respecta a la esmeralda"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
